  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience Development Governance (BRIDGE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this Project Initiation Plan, UNDP aims to ensure efforts on adding value of results from its post-disaster rehabilitation and reconstruction interventions, contributing to enhancing local resilience which is key in Disaster Risk Reduction. While undertaking monitoring the Defect Liability Period of reconstructed health and education facilities in 19 locations in Palu Municipality, Sigi District, and Parigi Moutong District, UNDP continues its advocacy to respective local government commitments for maintenance and improvement of the facilities in public service delivery. UNDP foresees the need to provide technical assistance to improve risk awareness and increase local government integration and involvement in planning preparedness, response, and recovery to either natural or man-made disaster occurrences.</narrative>
  </description>
